id: searx-auto-release
title: Automate change-aware releases with generated project history
description: "Port pm-cli's scheduled and manual change-aware release model with lossless pm-changelog history, calendar versions, protected tags, npm provenance, and npm plus Bun consumer verification."
type: Feature
status: closed
priority: 0
tags[6]: automation,bun,changelog,github-actions,npm,release
created_at: "2026-07-21T17:24:34.395Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-21T22:32:10.591Z"
deadline: "2026-07-23T17:24:34.395Z"
closed_at: "2026-07-21T17:43:32.728Z"
author: codex-root
estimated_minutes: 30
acceptance_criteria: No existing changelog data is lost; release only occurs for release-relevant changes; exact package version is verified through npm and Bun
definition_of_ready: "Live pm, changelog, tags, package registry, GitHub secrets, and pm-cli workflow state inspected"
parent: searx-security-modernization
reviewer: repository-owner
risk: high
confidence: 90
sprint: 2026-07-release-automation
release: next
resolution: Ported pm-cli release invariants to searxng-cli with repository-specific Bun installation and verification.
expected_result: Release-relevant changes automatically produce a verified calendar release while no-change and tracker-only runs skip safely and all legacy changelog data remains available.
actual_result: "Implementation, generated 40-item changelog, 31-entry preservation baseline, workflows, recovery docs, unit/E2E/package/audit/actionlint gates, and isolated full pipeline dry run all pass."
dependencies[1]{id,kind,created_at,author,source_kind}:
  searx-security-modernization,related,"2026-07-21T17:24:34.395Z",codex-root,null
comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-21T17:24:34.395Z",codex-root,Work is governed by the lossless changelog and exact-version publishing acceptance gates.
  "2026-07-21T17:43:31.591Z",codex-root,"Completed all three child tasks. Verified actionlint v1.7.12, five release contract tests, 622 unit tests, 60 E2E tests, zero audit findings, npx and bunx package smoke, and isolated clean-clone v2026.7.21 dry run."
  "2026-07-21T17:58:03.137Z",codex-release-agent,"Delivery PR #37 is open at exact head 763a950. GitHub checks passed for Node quality, Bun quality, package smoke, secret scanning, semantic title, and CodeQL. The PR remains draft because protected release credentials require repository-owner configuration."
notes[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-21T17:24:34.395Z",codex-root,Publish once to npm and verify the same package through both npm and Bun consumers.
  "2026-07-21T17:43:31.591Z",codex-root,Production scheduling becomes active when this workflow reaches master and the release environment contains RELEASE_PAT plus the existing NPM_TOKEN.
learnings[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-21T17:24:34.395Z",codex-root,GitHub tag pushes made with GITHUB_TOKEN do not trigger downstream push workflows; production uses RELEASE_PAT.
  "2026-07-21T17:43:31.591Z",codex-root,"A Bun-compatible publication means one npm registry publish plus exact-version bunx verification, not a second registry mutation."
files[3]{path,scope,note}:
  CHANGELOG.md,project,Generated release history
  .gitignore,project,Retain packaged pm-changelog runtime while excluding node_modules
  bun.lock,project,Stable pm CLI peer and audited body-parser override
tests[3]:
  - command: bun audit
    scope: project
    timeout_seconds: 120
  - command: "bun run changelog:preservation:check"
    scope: project
    timeout_seconds: 180
    pm_context_mode: tracker
  - command: "bun run test:release"
    scope: project
    timeout_seconds: 180
docs[1]{path,scope,note}:
  docs/release-process.md,project,Maintainer release documentation
close_reason: "Change-aware automated releases, lossless generated changelog history, npm provenance publishing, Bun verification, tests, and detailed pm evidence are complete."
body: "Port pm-cli's scheduled and manual change-aware release model with lossless pm-changelog history, calendar versions, protected tags, npm provenance, and npm plus Bun consumer verification."
